 Empire (2001) | PG\n\nA young linguist named Milo Thatch joins an intrepid 
 group of explorers to find the mysterious lost continent of Atlantis. Watch 
 the trailer here.\n\nSeating is first come\, first served. Registration is 
 not required\, but recommended for reminders and updates.\n\nSign up for 
