SUMMARY:Introduction to Blues Guitar 
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nLearn the basics of playing the blues! Students will learn 
 basic rhythm and chord playing as well as the Pentatonic/Blues scale. Learn 
 how to do basic improvising and be ready to jam with your friends! Bring 
