SUMMARY:Garden Qigong at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to register. 
 \nEscape into the tranquility of the summer garden and discover the 
 profound benefits of pausing. This class offers a gentle exploration of the 
 8 strands of brocade silk\, an ancient practice designed to cultivate 
 grace\, harmony\, and a deep sense of inner peace. Through careful gestures 
 and breath awareness\, you'll learn to listen to your body's wisdom and 
 find a sense of calm. Allow the gentle rhythms of nature to deepen your 
 breath\, soften your body\, and help you experience the world with renewed 
 vibrancy. This class is open to all\, regardless of experience. Come with 
 curiosity and a desire to connect with yourself and the beauty of the 
 outdoors.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n
LOCATION:Montclair - Van Vleck House & Gardens\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Personal Growth, Health & Wellness
