SUMMARY:The Psychology of Divorce: A Practical Guide for Coping with Separation-Related Challenges NEW
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nThis class will cover the positive and negative aspects of the 
 divorce experience\, from a psychological perspective. Coping mechanisms 
 and various resources will be discussed as ways to manage divorce-related 
 stressors. The class will include information pertaining to adequate 
 communication and age-appropriate support for children experiencing their 
 parents' divorce. Useful tips for selecting an effective team of 
 professionals to handle divorce-related legal\, financial\, and 
 psychological consequences will be provided as well.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Personal Growth
