SUMMARY:'Afro-Punk: The Movie that Sparked a Movement' Film Screening\, Talk and Signing with James Spooner NEW
DESCRIPTION:Join director James Spooner for a screening of his 
 groundbreaking 2003 documentary that explores race and identity in the punk 
 scene\, now remastered with additional features. Stay for a talk and Q&A on 
 the film's subject and pick up a signed copy of Spooner's new book\, It 
 Starts with Anger: A Punk Beginning. An AFROPUNK Ending. Co-presented by 
 Indie Arts Montclair. Free to attend\, register below.
