 join us at the library for some Fall favorites!\n\n\n\n\nDead Poets Society 
 (1989) | PG\n\n\n\n\nA staid but well-respected prep school is enlivened by 
 a newly-arrived\, charismatic English teacher\, who inspires his students 
 with unconventional methods and philosophies. Watch the trailer 
 here.\n\nSeating is first come\, first served. Registration is not 
 required\, but recommended for reminders and updates.
