SUMMARY:Movie Matinee: Lisa Frankenstein (2024)
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nLisa Frankenstein (2024) | PG-13\n\n\n\n\nLisa is an 
 unusual young woman who harbors a strange crush on a handsome bust adorning 
 a gravestone in her local cemetery. When a series of wild circumstances 
 reanimate the deceased man\, the two decide to give their fledgling 
 attraction a chance at life. Watch the trailer here.\n\nSeating is first 
 come\, first served. Registration is not required\, but recommended for 
 reminders and updates.
