SUMMARY:Theme of the Month Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Looking for new books to discover and fellow readers to connect 
 with? Join Theme of the Month Book Club\, a monthly gathering where 
 participants read a book of their choice based on a shared theme and come 
 together to discuss their selections.\n\nEach month\, a new theme will be 
 announced—such as historical fiction\, books by debut authors\, found 
 family\, travel\, mysteries\, and more! Rather than everyone reading the 
 same title\, participants are free to choose any book that fits the theme 
 and share their thoughts with the group.\n\nThis relaxed and welcoming book 
 club is a great way to broaden your reading horizons\, discover new 
 recommendations\, and enjoy lively conversations with other book 
 lovers.\n\nPlease register to reserve your spot!\n\nThemes:\n\nSeptember: 
 Fresh Starts\n\nOctober: Banned Books\n\nNovember: Gratitude and 
 Gathering\n\nDecember: Home for the Holidays
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Book Discussion, Book Club
